<title>UK: Italy ups 10-year bond to 3.0 billion marks.</title>
<headline>Italy ups 10-year bond to 3.0 billion marks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy has increased to 3.0 billion marks from 2.0 billion marks the size of its 10-year redenominatable Eurobond, joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and SBC Warburg said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The notes will be redenominated in euros after EMU.</p>
